OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBecoming windy with a risk of
OL,6,Fgales, especially near the coasts. A
OL,7,Fmostly cloudy day but staying largely
OL,8,Fdry before outbreaks of rain move into
OL,9,Fthe west later in the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will be cloudy in the
OL,12,Fevening and overnight with rain
OL,13,Fspreading southeastwards and becoming
OL,14,Fheavy at times. Strong winds through
OL,15,Fthe evening but easing overnight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FAny lingering rain clearing
OL,18,Fto the southeast in the morning.
OL,19,FMostly dry in the afternoon with just
OL,20,Fthe odd shower possible and brighter
OL,21,Fspells breaking through. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
